{"articleNo":"72324","sourceUrl":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_01.do?mode=view&articleNo=72324&article.offset=0&articleLimit=10","title":"방학 중 근로장학생 신청 안내(마감)","writer":"국립금오공과대학교","writeDate":"2012.12.18","hit":"6402","attachments":[],"contentHtml":"\n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n                \n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center; LINE-HEIGHT: 1.2\" class=\"바탕글\"><!--?xml:namespace prefix = v ns = \"urn:schemas-microsoft-com:vml\" /--><v:rect style=\"WIDTH: 368.97pt; HEIGHT: 20.72pt; v-text-anchor: top\" id=\"_x70135312\" strokeweight=\"0.33pt\" fillcolor=\"#ccffff\"><v:stroke></v:stroke><v:fill opacity=\"1.00\" color2=\"#000000\"></v:fill><v:textbox></v:textbox></v:rect></p><div style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.2\"><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 14pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-fareast-font-family: 바탕\" lang=\"EN-US\">2012학년도 2학기 방학 중 근로장학생 신청 안내</span></p></div><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.2\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center; LINE-HEIGHT: 1.2\" class=\"바탕글\">&nbsp; <!--?xml:namespace prefix = o ns = \"urn:schemas-microsoft-com:office:office\" /--><o:p></o:p></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: HCI Poppy; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조; mso-hansi-font-family: HCI Poppy\" lang=\"EN-US\">2012학년도 2학기 방학 중 근로장학생을 모집하오니 희망하는 학생은 기한 내에</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-hansi-font-family: HCI Poppy; mso-ascii-font-family: HCI Poppy\">해당부서로 신청하시기 바랍니다. </span><u style=\"text-underline: #000000 single\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: HCI Poppy; COLOR: #ff0000; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조; mso-hansi-font-family: HCI Poppy\" lang=\"EN-US\">(희망부서는 첨부파일참고)</span></u></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\" class=\"바탕글\">&nbsp; <o:p></o:p></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: HCI Poppy; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조; mso-hansi-font-family: HCI Poppy\" lang=\"EN-US\">&lt;근로장학생 </span><u style=\"text-underline: #000000 single\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-hansi-font-family: HCI Poppy; mso-ascii-font-family: HCI Poppy\">순위통과자 398명(1순위:308명) 발표</span></u><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-hansi-font-family: HCI Poppy; mso-ascii-font-family: HCI Poppy\">되었으나, 방학 중에는 근로장학생으로</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: HCI Poppy; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조; mso-hansi-font-family: HCI Poppy\" lang=\"EN-US\"> 선발할 수 있는 인원이 많이 제한되어있어 소수인원만 선발됨을 알려드립니다.</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: HCI Poppy; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조; mso-hansi-font-family: HCI Poppy\" lang=\"EN-US\">&nbsp;* 첨부파일에서 학생선발된 부서는 실시간으로 삭제됩니다&gt;</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\" class=\"바탕글\">&nbsp; <o:p></o:p></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: HCI Poppy; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조; mso-hansi-font-family: HCI Poppy\" lang=\"EN-US\">** 국가 및 대학근로 신청기간 : </span><u style=\"text-underline: #000000 single\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: HCI Poppy; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조; mso-hansi-font-family: HCI Poppy\" lang=\"EN-US\">2012. 12. 18(화)10:00부터, 12. 21(금)12:00까지</span></u></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\" class=\"바탕글\">&nbsp; <o:p></o:p></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: HCI Poppy; COLOR: #0000ff; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조; mso-hansi-font-family: HCI Poppy\" lang=\"EN-US\">1. 국가근로장학생</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: HCI Poppy; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조; mso-hansi-font-family: HCI Poppy\" lang=\"EN-US\">가. 자격 및 선발요건 : 재학생 중 한국장학재단 근로장학생으로 추천된 자</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: HCI Poppy; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조; mso-hansi-font-family: HCI Poppy\" lang=\"EN-US\">(해당자는 개인별 문자 통보)</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: HCI Poppy; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조; mso-hansi-font-family: HCI Poppy\" lang=\"EN-US\">나. 근로기간 : 2012. 12. 22(토) ~ 2013. 2. 28(목)</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: HCI Poppy; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조; mso-hansi-font-family: HCI Poppy\" lang=\"EN-US\">다. 근로부서 : [붙임파일참고]</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: HCI Poppy; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조; mso-hansi-font-family: HCI Poppy\" lang=\"EN-US\">라. 신청방법</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: HCI Poppy; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조; mso-hansi-font-family: HCI Poppy\" lang=\"EN-US\">* </span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조; COLOR: #ff0000; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-hansi-font-family: HCI Poppy; mso-ascii-font-family: HCI Poppy\">근로장학생 희망부서 근무 신청[직접방문 또는 전화] </span><u style=\"text-underline: #000000 single\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: HCI Poppy; COLOR: #ff0000; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조; mso-hansi-font-family: HCI Poppy\" lang=\"EN-US\">(12. 18(화), 12. 21(금)12:00까지)</span></u><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: HCI Poppy; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조; mso-hansi-font-family: HCI Poppy\" lang=\"EN-US\"> </span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: HCI Poppy; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조; mso-hansi-font-family: HCI Poppy\" lang=\"EN-US\">→ 근로</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-hansi-font-family: HCI Poppy; mso-ascii-font-family: HCI Poppy\">장학생 희망부서 </span><u style=\"text-underline: #000000 single\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-hansi-font-family: HCI Poppy; mso-ascii-font-family: HCI Poppy\">온라인신청</span></u><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: HCI Poppy; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조; mso-hansi-font-family: HCI Poppy\" lang=\"EN-US\">[근무부서와 협의 완료 후</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: HCI Poppy; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조; mso-hansi-font-family: HCI Poppy\" lang=\"EN-US\"> 신청] → 근로장학생</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: HCI Poppy; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조; mso-hansi-font-family: HCI Poppy\" lang=\"EN-US\">선발 확정(12.21(금))</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: HCI Poppy; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조; mso-hansi-font-family: HCI Poppy\" lang=\"EN-US\">※ </span><u style=\"text-underline: #000000 single\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-hansi-font-family: HCI Poppy; mso-ascii-font-family: HCI Poppy\">온라인신청</span></u><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-hansi-font-family: HCI Poppy; mso-ascii-font-family: HCI Poppy\">방법 : </span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-hansi-font-family: HCI Poppy; mso-ascii-font-family: HCI Poppy\">원스톱서비스 로그인 - 학생지원 - ‘근로장학생 신청서 제출’에서 희망근무부서 선택 - 신청 클릭 - 완료[별도서류 제출 없음]</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: HCI Poppy; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조; mso-hansi-font-family: HCI Poppy\" lang=\"EN-US\">마. 근로장학금액</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: HCI Poppy; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조; mso-hansi-font-family: HCI Poppy\" lang=\"EN-US\">- 교내근로 : 시간당 급여 6,000원</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: HCI Poppy; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조; mso-hansi-font-family: HCI Poppy\" lang=\"EN-US\">- 전공관련산업체 : 시간당 급여 8,000원</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\" class=\"바탕글\">&nbsp; <o:p></o:p></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: HCI Poppy; COLOR: #0000ff; 